     more than one, each of them may act on their own.


How to apply this license to a file
-----------------------------------

Put these two lines at the top of the file with the other header comments, and
ship this LICENSE file with the source:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-brain-emu-1.0
    Copyright (c) 2026 the brain-emu authors.  See LICENSE.

"LicenseRef-brain-emu-1.0" is the identifier to use for this license text.  The
license is not an SPDX-listed license; the "LicenseRef-" prefix is how SPDX
names a license whose text ships with the work, and it is what makes a scan tell
You to read this file rather than to assume some other terms.

This notice is part of the license, and is itself covered by it.
END OF TERMS
